    "_postman_id": "a0d230a8-9aa6-4a79-b354-6e5a1dc18f72",
    "name": "Learning Task API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the routes mounted in src/app.ts.\n\nRegister or Login saves token, username, and userUuid. Admin Login saves adminToken. Create Story saves storySlug, storyUuid, and storyIdentifier. Add Comment saves commentUuid.\n\nBodies include every accepted field, including optional ones, with sample values. Remove a query param when you do not want that filter.\n\nPaginated responses use a unified structure:\n- `data`: Array of paginated items (stories, users, followers, likes, comments)\n- `meta`: Pagination metadata (`page`, `limit`, `total`, `totalPages`, `nextPage`, `prevPage`)\n\nStory status: draft, published.\nStory visibility: public, followers_only.\nStory identifiers: public endpoints use slug, interaction endpoints (likes/comments) pass story_uuid in query params for GET requests or body for POST/DELETE.\nUser identifiers: public profile uses username, follow endpoints pass user_uuid in request body.\nUsernames may contain letters, numbers, underscores, hyphens, and periods.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
